# DOT & DASH: a route test for the deep world. Under every micro strip of
# the room and the walls, the deep strip beneath its middle is built and
# checked the same way: everything in it reachable on foot.
game dotdash
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat verify_area 0 1
expect verify_bad == 0
cheat verify_area 2 1
expect verify_bad == 0
